WEBVTT

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:37.110
I can't find it... I wonder where it went...

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:20.030
"A New Chapter"

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:20.190
And that's why
you're going to Venice?

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:22.570
Yes, that's how it turned out.

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:23.940
When do you leave?

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:25.400
Um... tomorrow.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:26.650
Tomorrow?!

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:29.030
It's all so sudden...

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:32.320
It does seem very like you, though.

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:39.030
Be that as it may, a Florence without you...

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:41.610
...will be lonely...

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.940
What? Arte is...?!

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:46.780
That's what I heard. Isn't she amazing?

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:48.610
It's a huge job!

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:51.230
As a fellow apprentice,
it's frustrating, though.

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:54.780
Don't get frustrated. You should cheer her on.

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:58.530
Hey, Angelo?

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.610
You're going to Venice?

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:08.070
Yeah, so about your studies while I'm away--

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:12.820
Can you go borrow your own
study books from Veronica?

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:15.230
Me? By myself?

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:16.900
Arte!

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:19.610
Angelo!

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.440
Oh, good... I finally found you...

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:27.650
What's the matter?

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:29.690
I heard from the other apprentices
at the workshop!

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:34.530
Is it true you're going to Venice?!
This suddenly? I'll never see you again?

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:35.780
What?!

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:37.610
I'll never see you again?!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:43.650
Huh? Uh... um... It looks like
there's been a misunderstanding...

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:46.530
It'll be fine! It's only for six months!

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:48.650
Huh? Six months?

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:52.940
Oh, so it's not like we'll
never see you again, right?

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:54.860
Yeah, I'll be back.

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:58.070
Oh, good. You scared me...

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:00.610
Um, by the way...

00:04:00.610 --> 00:04:03.440
Is he a friend of yours, Arte?

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:08.360
Oh, yeah. You two haven't met yet, huh?
He's an apprentice, like me. His name's Angelo.

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:12.400
Angelo, this is my friend,
Darcia. She's a seamstress.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.780
Nice to meet you!

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:17.820
I wish you hadn't seen me when I was panicked.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.150
Sorry if I surprised you.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:23.820
Darcia?!

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.980
Are you okay?

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:27.980
My hand...

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:30.360
Huh? Is it my fault?

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:39.860
Oof.

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:44.570
Well then, it's time to leave.
You should get in the carriage, too.

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:46.190
Okay.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:53.230
Leo, I'll see you in six months, then!

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.400
Arte.

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:58.610
Sooner or later, you will have
to leave this workshop

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:05.730
and get work with your own abilities
to put food on the table.

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:08.190
The job this time is a good opportunity.

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:12.650
Think carefully about what I just
said when you're in Venice.

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:18.610
I think, if the result is that when
you finish your job in six months,

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:22.190
you don't come back here, that's fine, too.

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:24.690
Huh? Um...

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:29.570
Arte. We're leaving. Please come inside.

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.440
Lord Falier.

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:39.110
I'm leaving her in your care.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:44.570
I will take care of her.

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:55.900
Arte, this is for you.

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:58.400
He gave it to me to give to you.

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:02.780
A portable altarpiece.

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:09.480
This is Leo's work...

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:19.280
What? I'm not food, you know.

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:34.110
It's too quiet...

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:44.030
Thank you for letting us stay with you.

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:55.440
Why did Leo say something like that...?

00:06:56.530 --> 00:07:01.320
Once you get to Venice,
you don't have to come back.

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:04.150
Huh? No, Leo!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.690
Wait...

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.650
Please, wait!

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:11.860
Oh, we're finally here.

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:14.900
Come, Arte.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:20.650
We'll be traveling by sea.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:31.440
We have good winds for our sea voyage this time.

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:33.230
That's good.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.820
Looks like you're having a hard time.

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:46.280
P-Please don't laugh at me.

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:50.190
How can you all walk normally
even though it's swaying so much?

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:54.030
That's because we're people of the sea, Miss.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:58.150
If we had such useless legs, we wouldn't
be able to get the ship moving.

00:07:58.150 --> 00:08:02.280
Once you get on a ship, you're the
only one who can keep you alive.

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:06.730
Besides, if we're attacked by pirates,
we'll have to fight on the ship!

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:08.190
What?! Pirates?!

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.400
Oh, are you surprised?

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:14.570
Don't worry, pirates don't come
to this part of the ocean.

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:17.980
Speaking of which, Lord Yuri, you haven't
been on a boat in a while, right?

00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:20.110
Hm? Yes, what of it?

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:23.940
Have your skills gotten rusty?

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:27.780
How about it? Wanna have a match with me?

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:28.820
Oh, good idea!

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.530
Do it, do it!

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:31.610
Why not?

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:32.530
Huh?!

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:37.860
My body was stiff from riding
in a carriage for so long.

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:53.190
Wow...

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:57.980
I can't believe they can move so nimbly
even though we're on a boat...

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:00.610
It appears you <i>have</i> gotten rusty!

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:03.780
I'll take today's match!

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:05.530
Well...

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:09.320
I wonder about that!

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:16.730
I win.

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:19.570
As expected of Lord Yuri!

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:21.360
It was a close one!

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:24.900
That wasn't fair, Lord Yuri!

00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:28.570
Aren't you embarrassed to use
such an underhanded trick?

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:34.360
When you're stabbed by an enemy in real battle,
will you make excuses like that in Heaven, too?

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:36.690
He's right. You're acting disgraceful.

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:39.360
Accept your loss quietly!

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:55.280
I wonder if Leo thinks I'm in the way now...

00:09:55.280 --> 00:10:00.070
Was that a parting gift to me
because we would never meet again?

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:04.110
It's true that Leo didn't
normally take on apprentices,

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:08.400
but I pushed myself on him
to make him take me on.

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:10.360
I thought I was doing my best,

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:13.320
but maybe I didn't help him
as much as I thought I did.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:17.780
Was I actually holding him back instead?

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:24.730
Round and round... I just keep
thinking about the same things...

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:31.690
Even though I won't get an answer
no matter how much I think about it...

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:35.730
I mean, Leo's not here right now.

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:40.820
If he were here, then I could
just ask him directly.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:44.860
Oh, no! I sweat on the paper!

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:49.110
My clothes are damp, too...
I'll go back to my cabin and--

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:06.280
Hey, the girl went overboard!

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:19.110
Where am I...?

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:20.690
Are you awake?

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:21.900
Yuri?

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:26.280
Oh, good. You weren't waking up,
so I was worried.

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:29.480
Um, I...

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:34.940
Oh, he helped me look after you.

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:39.480
O-Oh, really? I'm sorry to cause you trouble.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.940
I'm wearing different clothes...?

00:11:41.940 --> 00:11:46.940
Oh, they were wet, so he
and I changed your clothes.

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:50.070
Wh-Wh-Wha--?!

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:51.900
Don't worry about it.

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:58.610
He's my servant, and I have absolutely
no interest in young girls like you.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:04.780
Um, I'm really sorry for causing trouble
for the people on the ship, too.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:09.360
You stop seeing what's around you
when something's bothering you, huh?

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:11.070
Huh?

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:13.030
I'm sorry...

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:17.860
I wonder if that caused Leo trouble, too...

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:19.530
I don't think Master Leo told you

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:23.730
that you didn't need to come back
because he thought you were in the way.

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:24.730
Huh?

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:29.030
Before we left Florence, Master Leo came to me.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:30.690
He did?

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:34.900
Yuri, did Leo say anything to you?

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:40.320
Arte, how do you plan on
making a living as an artist?

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:44.280
Huh? Um... well...

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.190
The same way as Leo...?

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:51.320
You and Master Leo are different.

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:54.820
Right now, he's the master of a workshop,
and you're his apprentice, but...

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:58.360
Because she's a former noble,
she can do things differently from me--

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:01.400
different possibilities lie before her.

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:04.980
I don't want to limit her possibilities.

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:14.110
That's why I think he wanted to
tell you that there are other paths

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:17.860
than continuing to learn under him.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:22.030
He went out of his way to come
and ask me to look out for you.

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:27.190
Why would he do that if he thought
you were in the way?

00:13:31.650 --> 00:13:36.230
You could tell what I was worried about, huh?

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:38.530
That's embarrassing...

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:40.480
When did you realize?

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:42.900
Hm? From the beginning.

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:46.940
I could tell that you were worried,

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:52.690
but it was too fun to watch you,
so I left you alone for a while on purpose.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:56.820
I don't really understand you.

00:13:56.820 --> 00:14:00.900
Oh, right! I also have a message
to you from him.

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.690
A message?

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:07.280
Before you start worrying,
make sure you do your job properly.

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:12.530
I will!

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:15.860
Good, you're finally back to being yourself.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:17.900
That's better.

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:20.280
I liked those eyes of yours.

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:23.690
That's why I decided I would definitely
take you back to Venice with me.

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.440
My eyes?

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:29.980
Your eyes when you came to refuse
my job offer the first time.

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:35.030
Lord Yuri, it's about time.

00:14:35.030 --> 00:14:36.440
Very well.

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:40.110
Arte, come with me.
You'll be able to see something good.

00:14:40.110 --> 00:14:44.320
You can't see this view
if you're not on the ocean.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.980
See? Take a look!

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:55.440
That's our city...

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:00.900
...Venice.

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:05.150
Wow... It's an amazing city...

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:08.820
I'm starting to get excited!

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:14.730
Um, is something the matter?

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:18.030
Oh, I was just thinking that you've
already cheered up completely.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:20.860
I never get tired of watching you.

00:15:20.860 --> 00:15:22.400
Okay...

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:27.280
Be careful.

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:38.860
Wow...

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:43.690
Everyone's clothes and hair
and eye colors are all different!

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:46.110
Are they Ottomans?

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:47.940
Spanish...

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:49.480
Greek?

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:53.610
Diverse people and things from
all over the world gather here.

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:57.150
If you stop and look at all
of them, you'll never finish.

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:59.110
Now, let's go.

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:02.940
U-Um...!

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.440
I can't stay standing!

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:11.480
The people of Venice can ride
any kind of boat, huh?

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:12.940
Of course.

00:16:12.940 --> 00:16:18.190
Look. You can easily tell
who's Venetian and who isn't.

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:19.230
Huh?

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:24.230
The ones standing are Venetians.
The ones sitting are foreigners.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:27.900
You're right! It really is obvious!

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:32.150
Before we go to my niece's house,
we'll stop by my place.

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:35.280
I'd like you to stay at my place
for two or three days.

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:43.780
What is all this? Wow, they're all
things I've never seen before!

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:48.440
I buy and collect things from
the Orient. It's my hobby.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:54.400
Um, why can't I go directly
to your niece's house?

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:59.530
Hm? Oh, the previous tutor just quit.

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:02.900
So it looks like it'll take some time
for your room to be ready.

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:05.230
Quit? Why...?

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:06.440
I told you, didn't I?

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:12.820
None of the previous tutors knew
what to do with her, so they quit.

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:15.860
My niece is stubborn.

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:23.400
Leo, it looks like I've been
entrusted with a tough job.

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:37.230
Is the dress comfortable?

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:39.320
Yes, it's wonderful!

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:43.940
Such finely tailored clothes are wasted on me.

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:48.190
This lace is excellent.
As expected of Venetian lace.

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:51.820
I've heard that it's of especially high quality.

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:54.860
I'm glad to hear that.

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:57.320
I'll go greet my sister-in-law.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:00.440
Have them take you to your room.

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:01.820
Okay!

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:05.150
Well then, Miss Arte, I'll take your luggage...

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:06.230
It's heavy!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:09.190
It's fine! I'll carry it myself!

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:10.530
Huh? But--

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:14.110
Oh, my, are you my successor?

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:16.570
I'll give you one piece of advice--

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:20.150
The girl who lives here is
completely unmanageable.

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:23.400
Well, shall we go?

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:26.030
Please show me to my room.

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:30.730
She really carried it to
the fourth floor by herself!

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:34.110
What in the world is she?

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:39.230
It's lovely! I can see the ocean from my room!

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:41.780
Now, let's see...

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:43.780
Miss Arte.

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:47.860
I was told to help you unpack.

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:50.190
Please let me know if you need anything.

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:52.320
Huh? Help?

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:54.480
Help, huh?

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:56.070
What's your name?

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:58.820
My name is Daphne...

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:01.480
Daphne, right? I don't need help.

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:03.190
But it's nice to meet you!

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:05.900
U-Um, what is that for...?

00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:09.070
What do you mean, what? Let's shake hands.

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:15.730
Daphne!

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:18.440
How was the new tutor?

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:20.690
How was she...?

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:24.860
She was kind of strange...

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:32.150
Leo, I'll do my best!

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:35.320
My sister-in-law and niece
are waiting in the room.

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:39.230
Um, you've already told me
some things about your niece,

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:41.650
but what kind of person is her mother?

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.400
Let's see...

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:48.280
She's the most beautiful woman I have ever met.

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:50.570
Okay...

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:53.610
Sister, I've brought her.

00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:57.320
N-Nice to meet you!

00:19:57.320 --> 00:20:02.610
Arte, this is my sister-in-law, Sofia,
and my niece, Katarina.

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:04.860
Lady Sofia, Lady Katarina,

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:09.030
my name is Arte, and I will be
in your care starting toda--

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:16.190
Whoa, she's pretty!

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:18.570
M-M-My name is Arte!

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:21.280
I've heard about you from Yuri.

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:24.690
This is my first time meeting a female painter.

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:28.440
I'm already looking forward to seeing
how the portrait will turn out.

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:32.280
Y-Yes, ma'am! I will do my best to paint it!

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:34.980
Come, Katarina.

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:38.030
You greet Arte, too.

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:43.610
Hello, nice to meet you!

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:45.610
I look forward to working with you!

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:50.610
I'm sorry.

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:57.690
She's shy, so she has a hard
time introducing herself.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:04.230
I'd like you to also tutor her
and teach her etiquette.

00:21:04.230 --> 00:21:06.610
Yes, of course!

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:12.190
Well then, my sister-in-law and I
need to talk, so we'll leave you two.

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:18.730
Katarina, nice to meet you.
I'm honored to be here.

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:23.730
I'll be your tutor starting from today.
Let's have fun together.

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:28.030
I heard that you became an apprentice at
a workshop even though you're a noble?

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:30.530
Yes, that's right. Unusual, right?

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:34.030
Really? That's weird.

00:21:34.030 --> 00:21:39.440
Also, I heard... You carried your own
heavy luggage up to the fourth floor.

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:41.480
How <i>unrefined</i> .

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:45.070
I heard that you were a noble,
but that's <i>absurd</i> .

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:48.150
On top of that, you're just a <i>kid</i> .

00:21:48.150 --> 00:21:50.400
Oh, but I'll do my bes--

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:53.070
Are you planning to make <i>me</i> carry luggage, too?

00:21:53.070 --> 00:21:56.110
I don't need a tutor like that.

00:21:58.440 --> 00:22:02.230
I'm going to sleep for a bit
until they come back.

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:05.400
Don't wake me up.

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:06.820
U-Um...

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:12.650
You already introduced yourself, right?
I don't need to know any more about you.

00:22:12.650 --> 00:22:14.360
But, Katarina--

00:22:14.360 --> 00:22:16.730
You're so noisy.

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:19.230
I'm sleepy!

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:26.360
What...?!

00:23:56.030 --> 00:23:59.400
"Preview"

00:23:56.980 --> 00:24:00.530
When you're quiet, you look
just like a doll, though!

00:24:00.530 --> 00:24:02.440
In front of everyone but you.

00:24:02.440 --> 00:24:05.190
I'll do my best no matter what you say to me!

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:11.010
"Naughty Child"

00:24:05.190 --> 00:24:07.280
Next time, "Naughty Child."

00:24:07.280 --> 00:24:10.980
Be careful of the willful young lady!
